h3><p>Build with intention. Make something useful, take responsibility for it, and learn when reality disagrees with the plan.</p><h3>Be the change</h3><p>Work on yourself before asking the world to change. Health, honesty, and discipline are practices.</p><h3>Break the cycle</h3><p>Recognize inherited patterns that hold you back. Build knowledge, resilience, and options for yourself and your family.</p><h3>Build the community</h3><p>Share knowledge with compassion. Welcome questions. Treat disagreement as a chance to understand, not a reason to exclude.</p><h2>How the principles become work</h2><p><strong>Sovereignty:</strong> understand the tools and choices you depend on. <strong>Integrity:</strong> distinguish belief from evidence. <strong>Compassion:</strong> turn concern into useful action. <strong>The long game:</strong> build patiently enough to correct mistakes.</p><p>Jay draws inspiration from spiritual traditions and from Satoshi’s work. These beliefs guide the mission; they do not replace verification or make its outcomes inevitable.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="/playbook/">Read the practical playbook <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="btn " href="/about/">Meet the founder <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article></div></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="shell"><div class="footer-top"><div><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="BTCisGTO home"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">₿</span>BTC<span>is</span>GTO</a><p>Bitcoin. Truth. Compassion.<br>Useful tools. A public journey.<br>A long road toward Lola’s HOME.</p></div><div class="footer-links"><div><strong>Use</strong><a href="/tradingtool/">Trading Sim</a><a href="/edge/">Edge Tool</a><a href="/dashboard/">Bitcoin Dashboard</a></div><div><strong>Understand</strong><a href="/about/">Jay’s story</a><a href="/playbook/">The playbook</a><a href="/belief-system/">Belief system</a><a href="/whitepaper/">Bitcoin whitepaper</a></div><div><strong>